[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-STR001
TITLE: Record of the aircraft pytest run
STATEMENT: >>>
The test report shall record the command that was actually run and the result it printed. On 2026-11-20, from the repository root, make aircraft-test ran /projects/AirTrafficControl/.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q in apps/aircraft and printed 22 passed in 0.05s. Acceptance is this record matching that command and that result.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The report is written after the run, so the count is an observation rather than a plan.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Plan
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
